THAT FORM CANNOT FAIL, and the reason is the same circularity that sank the
first sigma cut. z_MAP = r / sigma_MAP, so selecting |z_MAP| > 3 selects small
sigma_MAP, and sigma_MAP is the NUMERATOR of the ratio. Exceedances land in
low-ratio items whether or not compression is real.

Measured on development, against a null in which the baseline's sigma is the
truth and M.A.P.'s sigma is merely whatever it was:

