result), cluster-robust SEs with t(G-1):

  alternative: compression at the corrected slope 0.38    POWER 0.977
  alternative: compression at the raw slope 0.32          POWER 0.990
  (development, 178 items / 18 blocks, for reference:     0.811 / 0.862)

